# Build output. Everything here is regenerated by build.ps1, and the APKs are
# published as release assets rather than committed.
build/
test/build/
*.apk
*.dex
*.ap_

# Signing material. Never commit a key, even a debug one.
*.keystore
*.jks
*.p12
*.pem
debug.keystore

# Anything that came off a phone or a site.
#
# This matters more than the usual reasons: survey data carries locations and times
# that say where someone was, and a client's drawings are not ours to publish. The
# app writes these into its own directories on the device, not here, but a careless
# copy into the project folder should not become a public mistake.
*.pdf
*.dwg
plans/
walks/
surveys/
*-survey.json
boresight-*.json
# Continuous-collection chunks written by Feed.java. The same reasoning as above and
# more so: a directory of these is a minute-by-minute record of where someone drove.
# Named broadly on purpose — a renamed chunk is still a chunk.
*.ndjson
*.ndjson.gz
bs-*.gz
known_hosts
ssh_hosts.json

# Screenshots and scratch captures from device testing.
*.png
!res/**/*.png
!skins/**/*.png
screenshots/
scratch/

# Editor and OS noise.
.idea/
*.iml
.vscode/
Thumbs.db
desktop.ini
